WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.900
The moon pulls the oceans into two bulges; the Earth spins through both.

2
00:00:05.626 --> 00:00:09.376
The moon's gravity pulls the oceans into two bulges.

3
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:17.010
The Earth spins through both bulges: two high tides a day.

4
00:00:19.275 --> 00:00:23.625
At the quarters, sun and moon pull at right angles: small neap tides.
